recoverBuffers
├── When unauthorized, manifest missing or classified custody is deficient
│   └── It reverts
├── When a treasury transfer fails
│   └── It atomically restores every buffer and retirement flag
└── When Safe recovers
    ├── Given classified inventory exists
    │   └── It exports exact classified assets, excludes unassigned cash and never touches leaves
    └── Given an empty or already retired manager
        └── It remains terminal and exports only newly received carry once
